WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.642 --> 00:00:04.892
(upbeat electro music)

00:00:42.173 --> 00:00:43.570
- And here it is,

00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:46.460
it's the Mavic Mini, this
thing is so incredibly cute,

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:49.130
like I can't even handle
it and it's so light.

00:00:49.130 --> 00:00:51.010
It is so light in fact that you do not

00:00:51.010 --> 00:00:53.480
have to register it with the FAA.

00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:55.300
So that's one of the newest drone laws,

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:57.590
is if you have an unmanned aircraft

00:00:57.590 --> 00:01:00.050
that is more than 250 grams,

00:01:00.050 --> 00:01:01.330
you have to make sure that you register it

00:01:01.330 --> 00:01:02.440
to legally be able to fly it.

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:06.260
So this is ironically 249 grams.

00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:07.260
It's crazy how small this is,

00:01:07.260 --> 00:01:09.960
like it's smaller than
my iPhone 11 Pro Max.

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:11.720
The max distance that this
will fly with the controller

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:12.810
is two and a half miles

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:14.700
and it has a 30 minute maximum flight time

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:15.810
on just a single charge.

00:01:15.810 --> 00:01:17.490
It has a micro USB port for charging

00:01:17.490 --> 00:01:19.460
and it supports 18 watt fast charging.

00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:21.120
For photos it's 12 megapixels

00:01:21.120 --> 00:01:23.430
and the max resolution for video is 2.7k,

00:01:23.430 --> 00:01:26.100
so you can shoot in 25
or 30 frames a second.

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:27.280
But if you switch it to full HD,

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:31.940
you can shoot 1920x1080, 25,
30, 50, and 60 frames a second.

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:34.670
It has both GPS and downward
sensors for vision positioning,

00:01:34.670 --> 00:01:36.780
so it can hover both indoors and outdoors.

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:38.490
There's also some snap prop guards

00:01:38.490 --> 00:01:41.160
which are best used indoors
in case you hit something.

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:43.390
I love DJI's quick shots,
much like other drones,

00:01:43.390 --> 00:01:46.060
it has the usual rocket, drony, circle,

00:01:46.060 --> 00:01:47.420
and helix camera moves.

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:49.790
It also has this newly
redesigned DJI Fly app,

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:52.290
the viewing area is 20%
larger if you compare

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:53.660
it with the DJI GO 4 app.

00:01:53.660 --> 00:01:55.510
I feel like this drone
is really being aimed

00:01:55.510 --> 00:01:57.910
at beginners, but if you're
an experienced drone pilot,

00:01:57.910 --> 00:01:59.670
I think this is gonna be super fun for us.

00:01:59.670 --> 00:02:02.170
This is the case, I
love this thing so much

00:02:02.170 --> 00:02:04.280
because you can basically
fit everything in it.

00:02:04.280 --> 00:02:06.570
You've got your drone, you've
got your battery charger,

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:08.960
and the controller but, underneath of it,

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:12.150
you can fit your cables and I
have some extra prop guards.

00:02:12.150 --> 00:02:14.600
I love this controller because
the joysticks are removable

00:02:14.600 --> 00:02:16.600
and this is probably one
of my favorite features

00:02:16.600 --> 00:02:19.820
the DJI finally started integrating
in the past few versions

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:21.070
of their drone controllers.

00:02:21.070 --> 00:02:23.180
This makes it so much easier for storage.

00:02:23.180 --> 00:02:24.260
This is the battery charger,

00:02:24.260 --> 00:02:26.260
which out of all the things
that DJI has ever made,

00:02:26.260 --> 00:02:29.480
like I really never have that
many negative things to say,

00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:32.500
but this battery charger
is so incredibly difficult

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:33.670
to get the batteries out of.

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:35.750
Like, am I doing something
wrong, I don't understand?

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:36.930
But once you get the batteries out,

00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:38.946
you can get 30 minutes of flight time.

00:02:38.946 --> 00:02:42.196
(upbeat electro music)

00:02:49.370 --> 00:02:51.040
I just wanna go on record saying that,

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:54.660
right now this is probably
my favorite drone to date.

00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:57.063
The size of the quality,
and even flying it,

00:02:57.063 --> 00:03:00.380
